ship = Ike Station 1
version = 1.12.5
description = Uncrewed orbital station for the 'Build a new orbital station around Ike' contract (9 seats: cupola 1 + 2 Hitchhikers 8; stack from the top: Clamp-O-Tron, OKTO, reaction wheel, Convert-O-Tron 125 on the cupola's top node, then the 2.5 m section; Convert-O-Tron 125, 30 kNm reaction wheel, RA-15 + 2 HG-55, 2 Gigantors + 6 OX-STAT-XL, 4 Z-400). Transfer stage Poodle + X200-32 stays with the station (~2.9 km/s: Duna ejection, capture, Ike transfer, Ike capture). Launcher: ADTP-2-3 adapter + S3-3600 (3.75 m, short) on a Twin-Boar (65 t of fuel in 12.9 m; the builder cannot flip parts, so no adapter back to 2.5 m: the S3-3600's flat bottom sits on the Twin-Boar's 2.5 m top), Skipper + X200-32 + X200-8. Fins on every atmospheric stage (Minmus Lab 1 lesson), draggy parts low, whole stack rigid + autostrut Root.
type = VAB
size = 3,10,3
steamPublishedFileId = 0
persistentId = 1095694838
rot = 0,0,0,1
missionFlag = Squad/Flags/default
vesselType = Ship
